    "title": "",
    "legend": "ARX expression, tumour size, and liver metastasis&ndash;free survival in primary insulinomas. <strong>A&ndash;C</strong>&nbsp;Positive ARX expression in 3&nbsp;metastatic primary insulinomas. <strong>D</strong>&nbsp;No ARX expression in a non-metastatic insulinoma. <strong>E</strong>&nbsp;Tumour size plot. Cases with liver metastases in the size plot are circled (green); WHO grade is given. <strong>F</strong>&nbsp;Kaplan&ndash;Meier curve of liver metastasis&ndash;free survival for ARX expression in the primary insulinoma cohort. The <em>P</em>&nbsp;value was calculated with the log-rank test.",
    "source": "",
